  "modules": [
    {
      "id": "uniequip_001_moeshd",
      "name": {
        "en": "Croissant's Badge",
        "zh": "可颂证章",
        "source": "official",
        "isMachineTranslation": false
      },
      "type": "INITIAL",
      "typeName2": "",
      "icon": "original",
      "description": {
        "en": "Operator Croissant has demonstrated a remarkable aptitude for preservation of the front and resilience against the enemy.\nThe Field Operations Department has thus passed the following resolution:\nThis operator shall be appointed a Defender Operator during field operations to exercise Protector responsibilities.\nIn witness whereof,\nThis badge is hereby conferred upon the above named.",
        "zh": "干员可颂擅长维持战线抵御敌人\n根据外勤部门决议\n在外勤任务中划分为重装干员，行使铁卫职责\n特别颁发此证章\n以兹证明",
        "source": "official",
        "isMachineTranslation": false
      },
      "servers": [
        "cn",
        "global"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "uniequip_002_moeshd",
      "name": {
        "en": "Combat Boots",
        "zh": "作战靴",
        "source": "official",
        "isMachineTranslation": false
      },
      "type": "ADVANCED",
      "typeName2": "Y",
      "icon": "uniequip_002_moeshd",
      "description": {
        "en": "3rd\nSkies all clear today in Lungmen. Went shopping with Sora, passed by a regular gear shop and stumbled on this alloy part pack, discount. Impulse bought a whole bunch. Ugh... purse bleeding out. Heart too.\n7th\nShone the whole dang day, might of blown a thermometer, but they got this new flavor of pastry in at my favorite street stall. Lined up an hour and a half in the blazing sun, belly burnt red. Used some ointment from Sora and it worked real well, stopped hurting before I even went to bed.\n10th\nAll clouds. Purchased a new umbrella. Savings blown, be eating instant noodles all next month. Would of been frugal some the past few days if I knew. Got some left over for a rainy day anyway.\n17th\nCloudy but turned clear. Red-braised rib flavor instant noodles taste pretty dang good. Could eat for a whole week without getting sick!\n20th\nClear but turned cloudy. Ate all the red-braised rib ones, just tamagoyaki chive flavor left. It's fine, but I can barely get it down.\n23rd\nI'm all out of instant noodles... not one pot left. Thank all goodness for Texas sharing her cookies. Swear to my starving eyes, for an instant she had holy light beaming round her face.\n24th\nStorming!! Sunny like heaven when I got up. Pedestrians all walked by my umbrella stand, none of them turned an eye, all kept walking. But gloomy clouds rolled in and everyone got caught right out. Drenched to the bone! And I sold out of umbrellas basically instantly. Score!\nKiller profits like that don't grow on trees. Should save it at the bank, play the long game. Always had an idea tucked deep in my heart—get an emporium of my own, right here in Lungmen.\nMaybe time to get started on that. Little sum like this seems like nothing compared to the sky-high rent in Lungmen, but it's a solid start.\n31st\nNew combat boots out, my favorite brand. Shouldn't of done it. Act rash and now nothing but regret. Maybe... Should spend a night reflecting proper on my deeds. I must be a terrible sight when greed goes straight to my head. Life's tough...\n1st\nHey, new combat boots come in real handy! Might of hurt my heart to spend so much, but was worth it. Not a waste, not one bit!",
        "zh": "三日\n今天龙门天气晴朗，和空一起去逛街，路过常去的装备店，发现里面的合金零件包正在促销，一时心动购入许多，呜……荷包大出血，心痛。\n七日\n一天都是大太阳，热到爆表，但最喜欢的路边摊出了新口味的糕点，在烈日下排队一个半小时，肚皮晒得通红，用了空送给我的药，非常有效，睡前不再痛了。\n十日\n天气阴，新购入一批雨伞，储蓄所剩无几，下个月得吃泡面了。早知道前几天就省着点花，好歹能留点余钱以备不时之需。\n十七日\n多云转晴，红烧排骨味的泡面味道还不错嘛，连着吃一个礼拜都不会腻！\n二十日\n晴转多云，红烧排骨味的吃完了，只有香葱烧蛋味了，还行，勉勉强强能吃。\n二十三日\n我的泡面已经吃完了……一桶都不剩了。谢谢德克萨斯把她的小饼干分享给我，那一刻，在饥饿的我眼里，她的面庞光芒四射。\n二十四日\n下暴雨啦！！起床时明明还是阳光灿烂的样子，路上的行人走过我卖伞的摊位，个个都是目不斜视直直向前。但很快，乌云赶了过来，很多人猝不及防被雨水浇了个全身湿透， 而我的伞在顷刻间被抢购一空！好耶！\n这狠赚的一笔非常难得，我应该存进银行，做一次细水长流的规划。一直以来我内心中都有一个想法——拥有一家自己的杂货店，就在龙门。\n或许是时候为它着手准备了，相比龙门价格高昂的地皮租金，这笔存款显得微不足道，但我认为，这是一个不错的开始。\n三十一日\n我最喜欢的牌子出了新款的作战靴……我不应该这样的，一时的冲动后便是无尽的悔恨，或许……我应该花一个晚上好好反思自己的行为，被欲望冲昏头脑的我一定很难看吧，好难过……\n一日\n啊，新款作战靴真的好好用，虽然花了钱很心疼，但是非常值得，一点也不亏！",
        "source": "official",
        "isMachineTranslation": false
      },
      "servers": [
        "cn",
        "global"
      ],
